Building an Azure Asset Inventory: A Layman's Guide with Gemini
When managing an Azure tenant, maintaining a clear asset inventory is essential. Using Azure Resource Graph Explorer alongside AI assistance makes it simple to discover, inspect, and filter core infrastructure components without needing complex scripts.

Step 1: Initial Exploration with Resource Graph Explorer
Instead of manually checking every subscription, use the Resource Graph Explorer in the Azure portal to pull a quick sample of your resources and inspect their schema:

resources 
